@startuml
title Payment Event Stream Architecture

actor Producer
queue "dpw3-events\n3 partitions" as Topic
rectangle "Consumer Group: dpw3-case" as Group {
    component "Consumer C1" as C1
    component "Consumer C2" as C2
}
rectangle "Processing\nmanual synchronous commit" as Processing
database "Committed offsets" as Offset

Producer --> Topic : event key = order_id
Topic --> C1 : assigned partitions
Topic --> C2 : assigned partitions
C1 --> Processing : ordered events per partition
C2 --> Processing : ordered events per partition
Processing --> Offset : commit after processing

note bottom of Topic
The same order_id maps to the same partition,
preserving order for events of that order.
end note

@enduml
